{"t":"Maze of Lost Souls/map","s":"maze-of-lost-souls-map-33d48","k":"outro","i":"assets/wiki/Mazeoflostsoulsimage3_b3ad6e.jpg","html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><p>Here are some of the maps of MoLS:\n</p>\n<hr/>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"-3 underground, for the higher level cave maps, see Fields of Glory\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"362\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Mazeoflostsoulsimage3_b3ad6e.jpg\" width=\"312\"/></span>\n<span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"-4 underground\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"368\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Mazeoflostsoulsimage4_1ab9b9.jpg\" width=\"307\"/></span>\n<span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"-5 underground\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"363\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Mazeoflostsoulsimage5_c4d219.jpg\" width=\"302\"/></span>\n<span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"-6 underground\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"370\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Mazeoflostsoulsimage6_2d832a.jpg\" width=\"304\"/></span>\n</p><p>Here are the maps of <a href=\"#/wiki/Demona\">Demona</a>, the final destiny for the explorers which enter the <a href=\"#/wiki/Maze%20of%20Lost%20Souls\">maze</a><br/>\n<span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Demona\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"229\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Demona_25e072.gif\" width=\"227\"/></span> <span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Demona2\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"229\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Demona2_4c2415.gif\" width=\"222\"/></span>\n</p></div>","quests":[]}